    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Appliances are drained, wiped, and wrapped. Utensils and cookware go into labeled boxes with padding. Glassware is double‑wrapped, and fragile items are marked “FRAGILE.”</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
